# Secrets. Storybook 7.0-10.0 could bundle a local .env into the built output,
# and the published Storybook is public — so a stray .env here is a live leak,
# not just a bad commit. See chromatic.com/blog/storybook-security-advisory
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
